```
Analyst question: Which findings still need a human decision, worst first?
Shows unreviewed findings with severity high or critical, newest first.
Note: uses the latest disposition per finding, since a disposition changes over time.
Grouped by lantern_finding_key, not lantern_event_id: event_id is not unique (docs/BUILD_LOG.md B2).
```
index=lantern sourcetype="lantern:finding"
| stats latest(lantern_disposition_status) AS status latest(_time) AS _time
        values(severity) AS severity max(severity_id) AS severity_id
        values(dest) AS dest values(signature) AS signature values(file_path) AS file_path values(file_hash) AS file_hash
        values(lantern_event_id) AS lantern_event_id
        BY lantern_finding_key
| search status="UNREVIEWED" severity IN ("critical","high")
| sort - severity_id - _time
| table _time lantern_event_id lantern_finding_key severity severity_id dest signature file_path file_hash
